<title>USA: Gerber Scientific unit award reduced.</title>
<headline>Gerber Scientific unit award reduced.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH WINDSOR, Conn. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gerber Scientific Inc said Friday the Court of Appeals for the United Kingdom had reduced to about $3.1 million an award to a Gerber unit from Lectra Systemes SA of France in a patent infringement suit.</p>
<p>The original award to Gerber Garment Technology Inc by the High Court of Justice, Chancery Division, was about $5.9 million, Gerber said.</p>
